# Kurzly Docker build context exclusions.
#
# Keeps the build context small and forces the image build to produce its
# own fresh artifacts rather than trusting whatever happens to exist on the
# host (dist/, generated Prisma client). Secrets and planning docs never
# reach the image (T-01-15).

# Dependencies (reinstalled fresh inside the image)
node_modules
**/node_modules

# VCS / editor / OS
.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
*.log

# Secrets - never baked into the image (T-01-15, INFRA-02)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# GSD planning artifacts - not part of the shipped application
.planning

# Build output regenerated inside the image, not trusted from the host
apps/api/dist
apps/api/src/generated
apps/web/dist

# Test-only coverage output
coverage

# Unrelated reference material / large local-only files
design_handoff_url_shortener
*.zip
